{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372370/extras/0706c368c3c1931c951d73e660366796.avif?t=1760624165\" width=618 height=96 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Moon Horror</strong> is a <strong>1\u20138 player</strong> online co\u2011op psychological horror set across derelict <strong>space stations</strong>.<br>You are a team of NovaTech Biogenics scientists investigating the <strong>Echo Project</strong> and its study of <strong>The Signal</strong>\u2014an anomaly that twists minds and architecture when the <strong>Blood Moon</strong> rises.<br>When it does, corridors shift into mazes, alarms wail, and something begins to hunt.<br>Survive together, uncover what happened here, and escape before the station (and your sanity) collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372370/extras/fbce04bb2e3ea0faf1b7a7743377f433.avif?t=1760624165\" width=618 height=96 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co\u2011op, not comfort.</strong> Up to 8 players. No weapons\u2014survive with planning, stealth, and teamwork. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity voice chat.</strong> Coordinate\u2026 or hear your partner\u2019s screams fade in the vents. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving threats.</strong> Face a terrifying hunter already stalking the station, with two additional creatures in active development. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural stations.</strong> A fresh layout every run: new routes, chokepoints, and hiding spots. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First\u2011person immersion.</strong> High\u2011fidelity lighting and audio sell every flicker, footstep, and whisper. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable scientists.</strong> 1 character model with <strong>6</strong> color variants to keep your team readable in chaos. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372370/extras/55a7e854bf99b4abe8785aed3534fcdb.avif?t=1760624165\" width=618 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Loop</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter at shift change under a calm sky.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade, distract, and outsmart the hunters while tracking <strong>The Signal</strong>. <br> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense horror, loud sounds, sudden audio cues, and occasional flashing lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist &amp; Follow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If this looks like your kind of nightmare, add <strong>Blood Moon Horror</strong> to your Wishlist so you\u2019re notified of updates and playtests.<br>We post dev updates and community polls on our Steam page.<br>(Community chat available on Discord\u2014see the panel links.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372370/extras/d684887bcfd5eb721a91c6bf597da6fd.avif?t=1760624165\" width=618 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372370/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1760624165\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste